WEBVTT

01:25.280 --> 01:31.000
‪ADAPTED FROM A SHUQI.COM NOVEL
‪ORIGINAL AUTHOR: SENLIN LU

01:34.000 --> 01:34.960
I…

01:35.040 --> 01:36.920
QINGQUAN, PALACE MAID

01:37.000 --> 01:39.000
I know who killed Hanxiao.

01:40.000 --> 01:42.080
Hongshao from
the Imperial Housekeeping Service.

01:42.160 --> 01:43.880
Yesterday, I went there to notify them

01:43.960 --> 01:46.560
of the lamp oil Consort Shu
will need next month.

01:46.640 --> 01:50.600
That's when I saw the red agate
gilded pendant on her chest.

01:51.480 --> 01:52.720
You recognize it?

01:52.800 --> 01:54.040
Of course.

01:54.120 --> 01:55.520
It belonged to Consort Shu.

01:55.600 --> 01:58.040
Once, while Hanxiao was helping
Consort Shu get dressed,

01:58.120 --> 02:01.280
she accidentally dropped it
and was terrified.

02:01.360 --> 02:04.240
But instead of blaming her,

02:04.320 --> 02:06.280
Consort Shu gave her
the pendant as a reward.

02:07.360 --> 02:09.160
Hanxiao was so grateful.

02:09.240 --> 02:12.280
No matter how short on money she was,
she'd never sell it,

02:12.360 --> 02:13.920
let alone give it away.

02:14.720 --> 02:18.560
Hongshao must have killed her
and taken it.

02:20.760 --> 02:22.000
Go to the Imperial Housekeeping Service.

02:22.600 --> 02:23.440
Yes.

02:23.520 --> 02:24.920
Did I break the law?

02:25.000 --> 02:27.280
Why should I tell you who gave it to me?

02:27.800 --> 02:30.200
Why are you making things
so difficult for me?

02:33.960 --> 02:35.320
Clearly, you don't know much.

02:36.000 --> 02:37.240
This pendant is made

02:37.320 --> 02:40.480
of the finest South red agate
from Jiannan Circuit.

02:40.560 --> 02:42.000
It's one of a kind.

02:42.080 --> 02:44.000
It belonged to Consort Shu.

02:44.080 --> 02:46.760
You'd better explain where you got it.

02:46.840 --> 02:47.800
If you don't,

02:47.880 --> 02:50.480
you'll be charged with stealing
from Consort Shu.

02:53.960 --> 02:55.080
It was Hu Da.

02:56.200 --> 02:58.600
Hu Da from the Palace Registry Bureau
gave it to me.

02:58.680 --> 03:01.080
Why would Hu Da give you
something so valuable?

03:02.680 --> 03:04.280
A few days ago,

03:04.360 --> 03:06.560
after I'd delivered something
to Lady Zhang,

03:07.160 --> 03:09.520
someone stopped me on my way out.

03:09.600 --> 03:11.040
He said Hu Da

03:11.640 --> 03:14.760
from the Palace Registry Bureau
wanted to get to know me

03:14.840 --> 03:17.760
and sent this as a gift.

03:17.840 --> 03:20.520
Hu Da is just
a secondary ninth-rank supervisor.

03:20.600 --> 03:23.680
Didn't you find it odd
he'd be so generous?

03:24.280 --> 03:27.000
Everyone knows Hu Da
is free with his money.

03:27.080 --> 03:30.320
Whenever palace maids
need funds, they go to him.

03:30.400 --> 03:31.480
Besides--

03:33.080 --> 03:35.840
That man kept saying…

03:36.960 --> 03:39.640
Hu Da truly adored me.

03:41.080 --> 03:43.000
Do you know the man
who relayed the message?

03:43.080 --> 03:44.240
Can you recognize him?

03:45.040 --> 03:48.120
It was so dark that night,
and he stood in the shadows.

03:48.200 --> 03:49.600
I couldn't see his face.

03:50.680 --> 03:52.400
So no one can vouch for your story?

03:55.520 --> 03:57.520
Not even in my wildest dreams

03:57.600 --> 03:59.960
would I dare steal from Consort Shu.

04:00.040 --> 04:01.520
If I had really stolen it,

04:01.600 --> 04:04.120
I wouldn't dare parade it around, would I?

04:04.760 --> 04:06.200
I'm not looking to get myself killed.

04:17.040 --> 04:18.720
There must be something
about him you remember.

04:20.720 --> 04:21.640
I remember now.

04:22.240 --> 04:25.360
He smelled of mugwort,

04:25.440 --> 04:27.160
and his hands were rough.

04:27.240 --> 04:29.000
That's it.

04:30.360 --> 04:32.440
That's all I can recall.

04:40.560 --> 04:42.880
Sweet olive balm.

04:44.280 --> 04:45.960
Good taste, Sister.

04:49.600 --> 04:52.960
Sister, aren't you going to sign
the promissory note?

04:55.040 --> 04:56.120
I am.

05:01.480 --> 05:04.560
Sister, why is your hand shaking?

05:05.800 --> 05:09.080
With your hand trembling like that,
you can hardly write.

05:10.080 --> 05:11.240
Let me help you.

05:20.600 --> 05:21.520
Supervisor Hu,

05:22.680 --> 05:25.000
I've signed the note.

05:25.520 --> 05:27.440
When will I get the loan?

05:27.520 --> 05:29.000
HU DA, SUPERVISOR
PALACE REGISTRY BUREAU

05:29.080 --> 05:30.640
"Supervisor Hu"?

05:32.320 --> 05:34.880
That sounds so distant.

05:36.080 --> 05:37.920
I only lend money to friends.

05:38.000 --> 05:42.920
Hearing you call me that makes me sad.

05:44.360 --> 05:45.240
What do you want?

05:45.320 --> 05:47.640
I want you to treat me sincerely.

05:49.320 --> 05:51.120
What are you afraid of?

05:53.080 --> 05:56.040
Do you really think
I'd do anything to you?

05:56.120 --> 05:59.080
Even if I wanted to, I couldn't.

05:59.680 --> 06:02.080
If you don't believe me, see for yourself.

06:07.000 --> 06:08.640
Blind fool, how dare you…!

06:10.240 --> 06:11.320
Princess of Fuchang County.

06:11.400 --> 06:13.000
Supervisor Hu,
what refined taste you have.

06:15.880 --> 06:17.280
It's all a misunderstanding.

06:17.360 --> 06:18.800
Outrageous.

06:18.880 --> 06:19.960
You insulted Her Ladyship

06:20.040 --> 06:22.000
and even harassed
a palace maid in broad daylight.

06:22.080 --> 06:24.600
Miss, don't slander me.

06:24.680 --> 06:26.880
I thought someone barged in
without permission,

06:26.960 --> 06:28.680
so I lost my temper.

06:29.440 --> 06:31.800
Your Ladyship, you are merciful.

06:31.880 --> 06:32.800
Please forgive me.

06:33.440 --> 06:34.280
Besides,

06:34.880 --> 06:36.560
I didn't harass anyone.

06:36.640 --> 06:40.520
She came to ask for help
and accidentally knocked over a scroll.

06:40.600 --> 06:41.400
Utter nonsense!

06:42.080 --> 06:43.320
What were you doing on top of her?

06:43.400 --> 06:45.920
Miss, don't ruin
a good person's reputation.

06:46.440 --> 06:49.160
Sister Birou fell, so I helped her up.

06:49.240 --> 06:51.760
Don't believe me? Ask her.

06:53.640 --> 06:55.240
Don't be afraid. Tell the truth.

07:00.040 --> 07:01.000
Enough.

07:01.720 --> 07:04.320
Supervisor Hu already said
it was a misunderstanding.

07:04.920 --> 07:06.520
I have questions for him. You may leave.

07:07.280 --> 07:08.360
Yes, Your Ladyship.

07:10.720 --> 07:11.760
Sister Birou,

07:12.720 --> 07:14.480
aren't you forgetting something?

07:14.560 --> 07:18.280
I've been wronged because of you today.

07:22.480 --> 07:23.920
Your Ladyship,

07:24.560 --> 07:27.400
I came to borrow money from Supervisor Hu.

07:28.080 --> 07:31.000
I slipped and fell just now,

07:31.080 --> 07:34.000
and he helped me up.

07:34.600 --> 07:37.480
Please, Your Ladyship, don't blame him.

07:39.000 --> 07:41.560
The misunderstanding is cleared up, right?

07:41.640 --> 07:44.080
If Your Ladyship has questions for me,

07:44.160 --> 07:45.960
may I get up first?

07:46.040 --> 07:47.040
You…!

08:03.040 --> 08:04.120
Wait outside.

08:08.440 --> 08:09.680
Yes.

08:12.800 --> 08:14.400
- Who is this?
- None of your concern.

08:16.560 --> 08:17.520
Did you know Hanxiao?

08:18.360 --> 08:21.040
After that "flower on the wall" incident,
everyone does.

08:21.120 --> 08:22.360
And before that?

08:23.320 --> 08:26.720
Before she left the palace,
I'd helped her out too.

08:27.320 --> 08:28.680
You lent her money?

08:28.760 --> 08:30.600
That's right.

08:31.360 --> 08:33.000
She still owed me
a tidy sum before leaving.

08:33.640 --> 08:37.080
Luckily, her resettlement payment
was just enough

08:37.159 --> 08:39.159
to cover the principal.

08:39.960 --> 08:40.799
What about the interest?

08:40.880 --> 08:42.520
I had to write it off.

08:44.400 --> 08:47.280
I lose money all the time.

08:48.560 --> 08:50.080
Then why do you keep lending?

08:50.160 --> 08:51.560
I'm softhearted.

08:52.080 --> 08:53.520
We're all unfortunate souls.

08:53.600 --> 08:56.080
If someone's in trouble, I help if I can.

08:58.760 --> 08:59.880
How kind of you.

09:00.760 --> 09:03.440
Did you help her after she left?

09:04.040 --> 09:05.600
Your Ladyship must be joking.

09:05.680 --> 09:07.920
The Palace Registry Bureau only places

09:08.000 --> 09:09.320
palace maids in temples after they retire.

09:09.400 --> 09:11.160
Where they go afterward

09:11.240 --> 09:14.600
is not our concern.

09:14.680 --> 09:16.080
So how could I have seen her again?

09:18.640 --> 09:20.240
But come to think of it,

09:20.320 --> 09:21.760
I did see her one more time.

09:25.160 --> 09:26.840
You mean in the palace wall that day?

09:27.520 --> 09:28.360
It's just a joke.

09:28.440 --> 09:30.360
Do you want to be put in a wall
and turned into fertilizer too?

09:32.200 --> 09:34.120
That was inappropriate.
Spare me, Your Ladyship.

09:34.200 --> 09:35.800
I can spare you.

09:36.320 --> 09:37.720
But someone else wants you dead.

09:39.360 --> 09:41.160
You're trying to frighten me.

09:43.720 --> 09:46.400
Do you recognize this pendant?

09:48.640 --> 09:50.520
That's a fine piece.

09:51.120 --> 09:52.200
I've never seen it,

09:52.280 --> 09:54.840
but I'd wager it belongs to a consort.

09:54.920 --> 09:56.800
Hongshao from
the Imperial Housekeeping Service said

09:56.880 --> 09:58.240
you gave it to her.

09:58.960 --> 10:00.360
Nonsense!

10:00.440 --> 10:02.480
That pathetic maid?

10:04.680 --> 10:05.760
This is priceless.

10:05.840 --> 10:07.920
How could I have gotten my hands
on something like this?

10:08.000 --> 10:10.520
But she made it very clear.

10:11.040 --> 10:12.960
It was Hu Da
from the Palace Registry Bureau

10:13.040 --> 10:14.920
who asked someone to give her this
as a token of affection.

10:17.400 --> 10:18.360
Your Ladyship,

10:18.880 --> 10:21.480
I'll admit it.
I'm a greedy and lecherous man.

10:22.080 --> 10:23.880
But money comes before women for me,

10:23.960 --> 10:26.560
and staying alive comes before all else.

10:27.280 --> 10:30.080
If you want, bring her here
to confront me.

10:30.160 --> 10:33.760
Have her meet every eunuch in the bureau

10:33.840 --> 10:36.000
until she finds this so-called go-between.

10:39.800 --> 10:41.120
It's getting late.

10:41.200 --> 10:43.520
Because of Miss Hanxiao's case,

10:44.040 --> 10:45.400
His Majesty is being extra lenient

10:45.480 --> 10:48.240
and will soon release
another group of palace maids.

10:48.320 --> 10:50.960
I still have plenty of work to do.

10:51.040 --> 10:52.880
I can't keep you company any longer.

10:53.400 --> 10:55.280
My apologies. Please understand.

10:56.800 --> 10:59.520
If you suddenly remember anything,

10:59.600 --> 11:01.400
be sure to come
to the Palace Investigation Bureau.

11:01.480 --> 11:03.880
I'll cooperate fully
with Your Ladyship's investigation.

11:04.520 --> 11:05.960
You don't like reading.

11:06.040 --> 11:07.520
Why keep so many books for show?

11:12.080 --> 11:13.160
I…

11:13.240 --> 11:14.840
Of course, I love to read.

11:15.440 --> 11:17.320
These are all books I read often.

11:22.760 --> 11:23.840
Your Ladyship, take care.

11:28.720 --> 11:30.120
BOOK OF RITES

11:36.960 --> 11:38.720
Hu Da has an errand outside the palace.

11:39.400 --> 11:42.400
You noticed his carriage
was ready to go too?

11:46.240 --> 11:47.160
I checked.

11:47.240 --> 11:48.880
There's no mugwort in his courtyard.

11:48.960 --> 11:50.840
And his room had only a delicate scent.

11:50.920 --> 11:52.200
He'd never use mugwort.

11:52.720 --> 11:55.400
Someone's trying to pin
Hanxiao's death on Hu Da.

11:56.280 --> 11:57.120
Serves him right.

11:57.200 --> 11:59.440
Even I wanted to hit him.

11:59.520 --> 12:00.920
He must've made a lot of enemies.

12:01.000 --> 12:03.040
He says he helps people out with loans,

12:03.120 --> 12:05.720
but it's really just private lending
with outrageous interest.

12:06.360 --> 12:07.200
I should look

12:07.280 --> 12:09.720
into how a secondary ninth-rank supervisor
got so much money.

12:11.120 --> 12:13.320
A copy of the Book of Rites
is on the third shelf of his bookcase.

12:13.400 --> 12:15.880
If we can get it,
there should be some leads inside.

12:16.480 --> 12:17.280
The Book of Rites?

12:17.360 --> 12:19.800
It's the only book on the shelves
that's been touched.

12:19.880 --> 12:21.640
I doubt it's because he likes reading it.

12:27.360 --> 12:28.320
Mr. Xiao, you may leave now.

12:28.400 --> 12:30.640
We won't trouble you with tailing Hu Da.

12:31.320 --> 12:33.600
I'm off duty tonight.
I'll go with Your Ladyship.

12:39.960 --> 12:41.160
Let's go.

13:01.600 --> 13:02.920
Welcome, sir.

13:09.120 --> 13:10.360
Shadowing people is tedious.

13:10.440 --> 13:12.240
Feel free to head back whenever you like.

13:12.320 --> 13:14.320
Stargazing can be just as monotonous.

13:14.400 --> 13:16.880
Sometimes, it takes months
for a star to move even a little.

13:17.920 --> 13:19.640
Then I'm sure you'll be good at this.

13:20.920 --> 13:23.680
But Hu Da was in such a hurry
to come out and run errands.

13:23.760 --> 13:25.960
Why is he sitting down for a drink now?

13:31.440 --> 13:32.480
Something's off!

13:40.320 --> 13:42.720
- Where's the man who sat here?
- I don't know.

13:42.800 --> 13:44.840
- Is there a back door?
- No.

13:58.120 --> 13:59.160
Something's off!

14:05.080 --> 14:06.040
That carriage.

14:12.400 --> 14:13.320
This way.

14:14.160 --> 14:15.960
How do you know which way to go?

14:16.040 --> 14:17.680
That carriage is wider than most.

14:17.760 --> 14:18.800
There are only so many lanes it can take.

14:18.880 --> 14:20.680
We're now
in the northeast corner of the ward.

14:20.760 --> 14:22.600
There's only one direction it can go.

14:25.040 --> 14:27.440
The carriage is quick,
but we can take shortcuts on foot.

14:27.520 --> 14:28.680
Even at our current pace,

14:28.760 --> 14:30.720
we can intercept him
at the entrance of Yanle Lane.

14:31.760 --> 14:32.840
In that case,

14:32.920 --> 14:35.040
let me show you an even faster route.

14:39.520 --> 14:40.640
Come on.

14:41.640 --> 14:42.560
Please go first, Your Ladyship.

14:43.680 --> 14:45.280
I forgot you didn't know martial arts.

14:46.520 --> 14:47.760
Official business.
I'm borrowing your horse.

15:00.480 --> 15:01.360
Your Ladyship!

15:24.120 --> 15:25.480
HANGUANG LANE

15:27.640 --> 15:29.520
Roosters for sale!

15:29.600 --> 15:31.320
Big roosters!

15:31.400 --> 15:32.240
‪CHEN'S SPICE SHOP

15:32.320 --> 15:33.920
Roosters for sale!

15:37.000 --> 15:39.400
Who poured that slop? Come out here!

15:39.480 --> 15:41.440
How can you prove I poured it?

15:41.520 --> 15:43.480
It came from your shop.

15:43.560 --> 15:44.720
If not you, who?

15:44.800 --> 15:46.400
Look at my clothes! Pay for the damage!

15:46.480 --> 15:48.280
Blaming me for your own carelessness?

15:48.880 --> 15:50.880
- You heartless woman!
- Who are you calling heartless?

15:50.960 --> 15:52.160
You're ruining my business.

15:52.240 --> 15:53.080
You should be paying me!

15:53.160 --> 15:55.200
- Get lost! You stink.
- You!

15:55.280 --> 15:57.600
- You're not getting a coin from me.
- You can't…

15:58.440 --> 15:59.560
- Sir…
- What's wrong?

15:59.640 --> 16:01.600
She won't pay for the damage.
Please stand up for me!

16:01.680 --> 16:03.200
- He's the one who…
- Enough.

16:03.280 --> 16:04.800
- Sir…
- Get lost.

16:05.440 --> 16:06.200
HANGUANG LANE

16:20.200 --> 16:21.360
Stay away!

16:26.800 --> 16:27.760
Mugwort.

16:32.760 --> 16:33.920
Help! Help!

16:34.000 --> 16:35.360
Someone, help!

16:35.440 --> 16:36.880
Help!

16:40.720 --> 16:41.960
Step aside.

16:50.640 --> 16:51.760
Step aside.

16:53.440 --> 16:54.360
Don't move.

17:01.640 --> 17:03.240
Hu Da.

17:03.320 --> 17:04.880
Hu Da. Hu Da?

17:06.280 --> 17:07.200
Hu Da!

17:08.960 --> 17:10.359
Roosters for sale!

17:10.440 --> 17:13.040
- Who poured that slop?
- How can you prove I poured it?

17:13.119 --> 17:14.800
- If not you, who?
- Can you prove it?

17:14.880 --> 17:16.800
You are making a scene
and hurting my business.

17:16.880 --> 17:18.480
- You should pay me back!
- But I…

17:18.560 --> 17:20.160
- My clothings are ruined!
- Get lost!

17:20.240 --> 17:21.079
Who?

17:41.840 --> 17:42.680
Where did you go?

17:45.480 --> 17:46.480
Someone tried to kill you.

17:46.560 --> 17:47.480
Don't you want to know who?

17:47.560 --> 17:49.880
Plenty of people want me dead.

17:50.400 --> 17:53.400
Who knows which debtor it was this time?

17:53.480 --> 17:55.680
Where did you get the money
to lend out in the palace?

17:57.120 --> 17:58.880
The one after you
is either someone you've crossed

17:58.960 --> 17:59.800
or someone you depend on.

18:00.560 --> 18:03.440
You've already become
the scapegoat for Hanxiao's murder.

18:04.160 --> 18:05.280
I didn't…

18:05.360 --> 18:07.040
I didn't… I…

18:10.760 --> 18:12.600
Hu Da. Hu Da!

18:29.480 --> 18:31.440
Struck on the head,
the coachman died instantly.

18:32.040 --> 18:34.840
Witnesses said Hu Da
was bitten to death by bats.

18:34.920 --> 18:36.680
He wasn't bitten to death.

18:36.760 --> 18:37.920
He was poisoned to death by the bats.

18:39.520 --> 18:41.400
Your Ladyship, we found this nearby.

18:45.560 --> 18:49.080
Why would bats attack people
in broad daylight for no reason?

18:50.360 --> 18:52.160
Hu Da smelled of linglong grass.

18:52.760 --> 18:54.600
That's what drove the bats into a frenzy.

18:54.680 --> 18:55.880
Linglong grass?

18:55.960 --> 18:56.960
From incense in his room?

18:58.040 --> 19:01.360
No, there was linglong grass powder
on his clothes.

19:01.960 --> 19:03.360
Someone sprinkled it on him
during the commotion.

19:04.520 --> 19:06.880
But where could that many bats
have been hidden?

19:07.920 --> 19:08.800
HANGUANG LANE

19:12.560 --> 19:13.680
The rope was cut.

19:15.320 --> 19:16.480
Interesting.

19:16.560 --> 19:19.720
From the moment that slop was poured,
Hu Da was in someone's trap.

19:22.320 --> 19:23.320
Mr. Xiao, did you go

19:23.400 --> 19:26.120
to chase after a tall man
in a black robe and hood?

19:26.200 --> 19:27.240
Yes.

19:27.760 --> 19:28.640
He was slightly hunched.

19:28.720 --> 19:29.960
He left deeper toe prints
than heel prints,

19:30.040 --> 19:31.760
probably from years
of hauling heavy loads.

19:32.360 --> 19:34.920
When you rushed to save Hu Da,
you brushed past him.

19:36.640 --> 19:37.560
Mugwort.

19:40.320 --> 19:41.880
I smelled mugwort on him.

19:42.560 --> 19:43.680
He's the one who set Hu Da up.

19:44.280 --> 19:46.360
It's a pity I couldn't catch up.
I overestimated myself.

19:46.440 --> 19:48.000
Don't sell yourself short.

19:48.080 --> 19:50.640
You picked out the culprit
with just a single glance.

19:50.720 --> 19:52.880
He clearly knows this area well.

19:52.960 --> 19:54.080
That's why he got away so fast.

19:54.680 --> 19:56.360
Take Hu Da's body back
to the Palace Investigation Bureau.

19:56.440 --> 19:57.680
The killer must be
someone from the palace.

19:57.760 --> 19:59.280
- He won't get far.
- Understood.

20:09.600 --> 20:11.240
Has Your Ladyship seen a mark like this?

20:11.320 --> 20:12.840
I saw it on that man's cart.

20:14.000 --> 20:15.840
You know the palace well.
Have you seen it there?

20:15.920 --> 20:16.880
The lavatories.

20:16.960 --> 20:19.840
Carts and barrels from
the palace lavatories all have this mark.

20:20.440 --> 20:21.880
That explains everything.

20:21.960 --> 20:24.160
Night-soil collectors
haul carts all year round,

20:24.240 --> 20:25.320
so their footprints
are deeper at the front.

20:25.400 --> 20:26.800
They have free access to the palace,

20:26.880 --> 20:28.200
and their status is so low
that no one notices them.

20:28.280 --> 20:31.400
And they often use mugwort incense
to get rid of the smell.

20:31.920 --> 20:32.800
Mr. Xiao, you really are sharp.

20:36.160 --> 20:37.080
Your Ladyship.

20:38.840 --> 20:40.200
My apologies.

20:43.240 --> 20:44.880
We have a lead. Let's go catch someone.

20:44.960 --> 20:46.120
Your Ladyship,

20:46.200 --> 20:48.880
why were you holding Mr. Xiao's hand
in front of everyone?

20:50.000 --> 20:53.960
He was calculating
the killer's whereabouts.

20:55.880 --> 20:59.560
Did he really need her hand to do that?

21:09.520 --> 21:10.360
Your Ladyship.

21:11.400 --> 21:12.280
Among the night-soil collectors,

21:12.360 --> 21:14.040
is there anyone who always
keeps to himself,

21:14.120 --> 21:16.960
covers himself up from head to toe,
and likes to wear a hood?

21:17.040 --> 21:19.680
Your Ladyship, that's Lou Chuo for sure.

21:19.760 --> 21:20.680
Where is he?

21:20.760 --> 21:22.320
He should be out delivering

21:22.400 --> 21:23.920
golden soil from the palace

21:24.440 --> 21:25.600
to the eastern suburbs.

21:30.320 --> 21:31.280
You want it?

21:35.840 --> 21:36.880
Here.

21:40.520 --> 21:41.360
Sir,

21:41.960 --> 21:43.720
do you know a man named Lou Chuo?

21:43.800 --> 21:45.880
No. In this trade, we never ask names.

21:45.960 --> 21:47.360
He's a palace eunuch.

21:48.200 --> 21:51.400
Nine out of ten sellers
claim to be palace eunuchs

21:51.480 --> 21:52.680
just to get a better price.

21:52.760 --> 21:55.080
We're not fools.
We pay based on the quality.

21:55.160 --> 21:56.320
That's right.

21:58.560 --> 22:00.400
- Time to get back to work.
- We still have questions for you.

22:00.480 --> 22:02.840
This is an important seller.
We can't make him wait.

22:02.920 --> 22:04.360
He brings nothing but pure palace compost.

22:04.440 --> 22:06.240
It makes top-grade fertilizer.
Golden soil.

22:10.280 --> 22:11.360
- Let's go take a look.
- All right.

22:22.680 --> 22:23.760
Lou Chuo, right?

22:23.840 --> 22:24.920
LOU CHUO
NIGHT-SOIL COLLECTOR OF PALACE LAVATORIES

22:28.000 --> 22:28.840
Lou Chuo.

22:31.320 --> 22:32.360
Boss!

22:34.200 --> 22:35.040
Linglong grass.

22:42.320 --> 22:43.760
Don't let him get away!

23:21.560 --> 23:22.680
You're coming with me.

23:38.080 --> 23:38.920
So ruthless to yourself?

23:50.280 --> 23:51.160
Boss!

24:09.400 --> 24:10.880
You can't escape now.

24:11.480 --> 24:12.960
Your Ladyship, where should we take him?

24:15.360 --> 24:16.720
The Palace Investigation Bureau's
cells are full.

24:16.800 --> 24:19.160
Please take him
to the Court of Judicial Review.

24:20.160 --> 24:22.800
Your Ladyship,
are you handing this case over to us?

24:25.040 --> 24:26.480
I'm just borrowing a cell.

24:36.240 --> 24:38.240
Lou Chuo has the same rash.

24:41.160 --> 24:44.800
Earlier, we found a hard object
in the victim's mouth.

24:44.880 --> 24:46.520
After soaking it in hot water,

24:46.600 --> 24:48.640
it turned out to be a ginger slice.

24:48.720 --> 24:50.080
Why would she have that?

24:51.720 --> 24:53.800
Night-soil collectors stuff jujubes
in their nostrils

24:53.880 --> 24:55.760
and keep ginger slices
in their mouths to fight the stench.

24:56.480 --> 24:59.360
Hanxiao was probably
with Lou Chuo before she died.

24:59.880 --> 25:03.120
COURT OF JUDICIAL REVIEW

25:08.640 --> 25:09.680
Your Ladyship,

25:09.760 --> 25:13.040
is it really proper for you
to be around him now?

25:13.640 --> 25:16.520
This way, he can't commit suicide
or run away,

25:17.080 --> 25:19.040
and we don't have to deal with the smell.

25:19.120 --> 25:20.200
Isn't that perfect?

25:21.960 --> 25:23.200
Count your blessings.

25:23.280 --> 25:25.840
Her Ladyship is letting you
enjoy a hot bath.

25:25.920 --> 25:26.760
Now start talking.

25:29.800 --> 25:30.640
You…!

25:35.960 --> 25:38.680
Let me question him today.

25:42.080 --> 25:43.000
Please do, Mr. Xiao.

25:52.400 --> 25:55.320
Hu Da lent money and harassed women
in the palace.

25:55.400 --> 25:57.600
He made plenty of enemies.

25:58.680 --> 26:01.160
Did you kill Hu Da
because you couldn't repay your debt?

26:04.160 --> 26:05.240
No, that's not it.

26:06.000 --> 26:07.000
Was it because of a woman?

26:09.400 --> 26:10.640
You hated her?

26:12.640 --> 26:15.080
No, you loved her.

26:15.160 --> 26:18.120
Your love turned into resentment.

26:18.200 --> 26:21.240
You're lowly, dirty, and always reek.

26:21.320 --> 26:22.560
To her,

26:22.640 --> 26:24.960
you were like a fly or a rat,
something to avoid at all costs.

26:25.560 --> 26:28.840
The more you tried to get close,
the further she pulled away.

26:30.520 --> 26:32.800
But at the end of the day,
you were both servants.

26:33.320 --> 26:35.920
Neither was nobler
or lowlier than the other.

26:37.720 --> 26:40.440
She was just a woman. She deserved to die.

26:44.760 --> 26:48.200
Hu Da was better-looking than you,
rich, and generous.

26:48.280 --> 26:50.560
The woman you loved was drawn to him.

26:50.640 --> 26:53.040
You could never be like him in this life,

26:53.720 --> 26:55.120
and you hated him for it.

26:55.200 --> 26:56.240
That's why you killed him.

26:56.960 --> 26:58.080
Kill…

26:59.680 --> 27:00.640
Kill.

27:01.520 --> 27:02.480
Mr. Xiao,

27:02.560 --> 27:05.240
when did you get so good
at interrogations?

27:06.240 --> 27:07.200
I'm not.

27:07.280 --> 27:08.280
I just picked up a few tricks.

27:30.280 --> 27:32.760
What a shame. Hu Da isn't dead yet.

27:35.600 --> 27:36.640
How useless you are.

27:37.240 --> 27:38.880
You couldn't get the woman you wanted,

27:38.960 --> 27:40.200
and you couldn't kill the man you hated.

27:40.280 --> 27:41.920
Hu Da is alive and well.

27:42.000 --> 27:44.040
More beautiful women will fall for him.

27:44.120 --> 27:45.240
But you?

27:45.320 --> 27:47.440
The woman you loved is dead.

27:47.520 --> 27:48.400
You'll never get her back.

27:49.160 --> 27:50.160
You have nothing left.

27:54.800 --> 27:57.400
If you tell us how you killed Hanxiao,

27:57.480 --> 28:01.400
I'll let you kill Hu Da before you die.

28:01.480 --> 28:04.680
If you stay silent,
I'll still let you live,

28:04.760 --> 28:06.760
but it'll be a fate worse than death.

28:11.720 --> 28:12.880
Your choice.

28:16.320 --> 28:17.320
Fine,

28:18.760 --> 28:19.600
I'll talk.

28:20.200 --> 28:21.560
But if I confess,

28:22.320 --> 28:24.160
will you really report
everything as it is?

28:25.800 --> 28:27.680
There aren't many things I dare not do.

28:27.760 --> 28:28.600
Try me.

28:33.040 --> 28:34.320
Your Ladyship.

28:39.720 --> 28:40.680
Lou Chuo,

28:40.760 --> 28:43.240
you filthy wretch.

28:43.320 --> 28:45.160
What a spectacle you've made!

28:45.240 --> 28:47.240
How dare you waste so much
of Her Ladyship's time?

28:47.840 --> 28:50.200
Now, with ironclad evidence,

28:50.280 --> 28:51.840
your guilt is clear as day.

28:51.920 --> 28:54.200
Confess at once!

28:56.440 --> 28:57.480
Your Ladyship,

28:57.560 --> 28:59.200
this is certainly

28:59.280 --> 29:02.040
a unique spot for an interrogation.

29:06.160 --> 29:07.240
Lou Chuo,

29:09.080 --> 29:10.600
out with it!

29:13.640 --> 29:17.160
I put Hanxiao in the wall.

29:38.880 --> 29:40.960
I was born the son of a military officer.

29:41.960 --> 29:43.360
When I was little,

29:43.440 --> 29:47.440
my family got convicted,
and I was sent to the palace as a eunuch.

29:48.200 --> 29:50.920
I've worked as a night-soil collector
all these years.

29:51.000 --> 29:54.840
Dirty and smelly, I was shunned by all.

29:56.880 --> 30:01.160
The magnificence and splendor
of the palace

30:01.240 --> 30:02.520
meant nothing to me.

30:03.040 --> 30:05.280
No matter how beautiful the maids
or flowers were,

30:06.400 --> 30:08.200
I never looked at them twice.

30:09.240 --> 30:10.400
Every day after work,

30:11.200 --> 30:14.720
I'd return to my tiny room
that sunlight never reached.

30:15.520 --> 30:18.200
My only companions were the rats.

30:19.160 --> 30:22.640
But one day, I met Hanxiao.

30:23.240 --> 30:26.520
Night-soil collectors
rarely go to the Palace Registry Bureau.

30:27.120 --> 30:29.840
Each month, one of us goes there

30:30.360 --> 30:33.480
to collect pay for everyone,

30:34.240 --> 30:37.600
so as not to draw attention
or upset others.

30:38.360 --> 30:41.040
- Ugh. What's that smell?
- He stinks.

30:42.760 --> 30:45.520
Are night-soil collectors allowed
to collect their pay here themselves?

30:46.240 --> 30:49.400
That was the pay
meant for all the night-soil collectors.

30:50.480 --> 30:51.680
I didn't dare lose a single coin,

30:51.760 --> 30:53.360
so I scrambled to pick them up.

30:55.960 --> 30:58.440
Hey, filthy rat,
where did you get all that money?

30:58.520 --> 30:59.880
Did you steal it?

31:03.200 --> 31:04.560
I'm talking to you.

31:04.640 --> 31:05.840
Where is all this money from?

31:08.760 --> 31:10.160
Do you have nothing better to do?

31:10.240 --> 31:12.360
If you're so free,
help me plant flowers for Consort Shu.

31:12.440 --> 31:14.840
Please, Sister Hanxiao, have mercy.

31:14.920 --> 31:17.040
It's too hot. I'll get heatstroke.

31:17.120 --> 31:18.520
- Then get lost!
- Yes.

31:21.000 --> 31:22.640
In all my years in the palace,

31:23.760 --> 31:25.920
that was the first time
anyone had stood up for me.

31:26.000 --> 31:27.360
What are you staring at?

31:27.440 --> 31:29.240
Pick up your money and head back.

31:30.000 --> 31:33.240
It was the first time
someone had smiled at me.

31:34.080 --> 31:35.360
That person was Hanxiao.

31:36.800 --> 31:38.160
After that,

31:39.120 --> 31:40.880
I'd try to find a way to see her

31:41.600 --> 31:43.960
whenever I finished work.

31:45.360 --> 31:47.040
She worked in Consort Shu's palace.

31:47.560 --> 31:49.480
It was hard to see her,

31:50.160 --> 31:51.480
but I had my ways.

31:52.160 --> 31:55.000
Even a glimpse from afar was enough.

31:56.960 --> 31:58.640
But later, I realized

31:59.160 --> 32:01.240
she looked down on me

32:01.840 --> 32:03.120
just like everyone else.

32:04.800 --> 32:06.000
Sister Hanxiao.

32:08.200 --> 32:09.280
Supervisor Hu.

32:09.360 --> 32:10.520
About the loan you took,

32:10.600 --> 32:12.840
I'll charge you the lowest interest rate.

32:13.360 --> 32:14.200
Thank you, Supervisor Hu.

32:14.280 --> 32:16.080
However…

32:17.960 --> 32:19.040
Come with me.

32:19.720 --> 32:20.640
All right.

32:29.240 --> 32:31.040
She was nothing special.

32:31.640 --> 32:35.080
She was just like the rest,
chasing wealth and scorning the poor.

32:37.720 --> 32:39.920
So you killed her for that?

32:40.000 --> 32:41.800
If you don't want to hear it,

32:42.520 --> 32:43.480
I won't bother.

32:43.560 --> 32:44.560
You…!

32:44.640 --> 32:45.840
Chief Justice, please.

32:47.360 --> 32:48.360
Chief Justice.

32:57.400 --> 32:59.760
Lou Chuo, continue.

33:00.760 --> 33:01.640
Later,

33:01.720 --> 33:03.600
I heard she was leaving the palace.

33:04.600 --> 33:06.920
I thought it would be my last chance,

33:07.600 --> 33:09.440
so I secretly wrote her a letter.

33:10.720 --> 33:12.640
She didn't even reply.

33:13.640 --> 33:16.320
I thought we'd never
meet again in this life.

33:18.440 --> 33:21.560
But fate is unpredictable.

33:23.000 --> 33:25.000
One day, I found her lying in a gutter,

33:25.080 --> 33:27.440
hair a mess and clothes in rags.

33:27.520 --> 33:29.120
She'd been brought right back to me.

34:18.560 --> 34:20.760
I saved her

34:21.480 --> 34:22.760
and treated her well,

34:22.840 --> 34:24.719
but she still despised me.

34:25.239 --> 34:26.760
I saved her.

34:26.840 --> 34:29.600
Without me,
she would've died by the roadside.

34:31.920 --> 34:33.880
I kept her in my room

34:35.239 --> 34:36.120
and made her stay with me.

34:36.880 --> 34:38.440
This time, she didn't resist.

34:39.239 --> 34:40.080
She'd learned her lesson.

34:42.159 --> 34:43.000
And then?

34:44.040 --> 34:45.719
After ten days or so,

34:45.800 --> 34:47.239
she died.

34:49.280 --> 34:50.440
Even toward the end

34:51.480 --> 34:54.000
of her life,
all she could think about was Hu Da.

34:54.600 --> 34:57.040
She could never stop saying his name!

34:57.120 --> 35:00.280
But in the end,
wasn't I the one by her side?

35:00.360 --> 35:03.520
You killed Hu Da out of jealousy.

35:05.480 --> 35:07.480
Didn't he deserve to die?

35:10.560 --> 35:12.520
But Hanxiao had already yielded to you.

35:12.600 --> 35:13.800
Why did you kill her?

35:17.240 --> 35:18.480
I didn't.

35:20.840 --> 35:22.200
She was too weak.

35:23.320 --> 35:26.280
One day, I came back from work

35:26.360 --> 35:28.000
and found her dead in my room.

35:30.360 --> 35:31.520
It was just as well she died.

35:32.880 --> 35:34.960
At least she'd never leave me again.

35:39.920 --> 35:41.280
But after only three days,

35:42.800 --> 35:46.360
her body started to stink
and break out in rashes.

35:46.440 --> 35:47.760
It was awful.

35:48.480 --> 35:52.320
I had no choice but to bury her.

35:53.680 --> 35:57.440
You could've cremated her
or dumped her outside the palace.

35:57.960 --> 35:59.880
Why did you put her in a palace wall?

36:06.240 --> 36:07.440
That way,

36:07.520 --> 36:09.920
when I hauled waste
and passed by every day,

36:10.000 --> 36:11.160
I could see her.

36:23.240 --> 36:26.400
Could those wounds have formed
in just around ten days?

36:28.400 --> 36:31.280
The wounds vary in color.

36:31.360 --> 36:34.200
Clearly, there are both
old and new injuries.

36:34.280 --> 36:36.920
The oldest ones are over half a year old.

36:38.400 --> 36:41.000
Hanxiao must have been abused
ever since leaving the palace.

36:41.760 --> 36:43.040
Where did she go?

36:43.680 --> 36:45.680
Lou Chuo is still hiding a lot from us.

36:46.200 --> 36:47.400
Go look into Hu Da first.

36:47.480 --> 36:49.720
If it'd been truly just a jealousy murder,

36:49.800 --> 36:51.560
Lou Chuo wouldn't
have gone to all that trouble.

36:51.640 --> 36:52.680
Understood.

36:53.320 --> 36:56.280
Yes, a carriage picked them up.

36:56.360 --> 36:57.800
A few girls came out first.

36:57.880 --> 36:59.120
Then your sister ran after them.

36:59.200 --> 37:00.640
Do you know where they went?

37:01.440 --> 37:04.200
The Xuandu Temple only records
the departure time,

37:04.280 --> 37:06.240
not the destination.

37:07.600 --> 37:09.320
This should be the place.

37:12.040 --> 37:14.480
Taozhi, look how nice it is here.

37:14.560 --> 37:16.160
Didn't I tell you it'd be fine?

37:16.240 --> 37:18.280
This must be a good place to work.

37:18.360 --> 37:19.400
BAIRONG, FORMER PALACE MAID
MULIAN, FORMER PALACE MAID

37:19.480 --> 37:20.360
It really is nice.

37:20.440 --> 37:22.840
LINLAN, FORMER PALACE MAID
CUIZHU, FORMER PALACE MAID

37:23.440 --> 37:25.280
What kind of good job
could Hu Da possibly find for us?

37:25.360 --> 37:27.000
We should still be careful.

37:28.280 --> 37:29.880
Anyway, now that you know where we are,

37:29.960 --> 37:31.120
you can stop worrying.

37:31.200 --> 37:32.200
Go see your brother now.

37:37.240 --> 37:39.200
Ladies, you're here. Come with me.

37:40.000 --> 37:40.880
Let's go.

37:56.760 --> 37:58.000
This place feels strange.

38:00.280 --> 38:01.560
They provide food and lodging.

38:01.640 --> 38:02.760
Isn't that good?

38:02.840 --> 38:03.680
Yeah.

38:06.360 --> 38:07.800
But the room is so dark.

38:10.320 --> 38:12.440
You'll all be living here from now on.

38:13.040 --> 38:14.360
Now, hand over your travel passes.

38:14.440 --> 38:16.320
- Travel pass?
- Well.

38:16.400 --> 38:17.560
My travel pass…

38:22.800 --> 38:25.240
Sir, what kind of business
do you run here?

38:26.360 --> 38:27.520
You'll find out soon enough.

38:28.480 --> 38:29.520
Hand it over.

38:30.920 --> 38:32.120
If we're here to work,

38:32.200 --> 38:33.840
shouldn't we get
proof of employment first?

38:33.920 --> 38:35.560
Why are you taking our passes?

38:35.640 --> 38:37.160
Why so many questions?

38:37.920 --> 38:39.600
You're taking our passes
without explanation?

38:39.680 --> 38:40.560
Something's off!

38:43.320 --> 38:45.640
Does the wage you promised us still stand?

38:45.720 --> 38:46.960
Of course.

38:47.760 --> 38:48.920
As long as you work hard,

38:49.000 --> 38:51.000
you'll only earn more.

38:52.960 --> 38:55.160
No matter the pay, we shouldn't stay.

38:56.160 --> 38:57.120
Taozhi,

38:58.680 --> 38:59.560
I need the money.

39:03.520 --> 39:04.680
You really won't leave?

39:05.560 --> 39:06.960
I'm staying.

39:07.040 --> 39:09.680
Whatever the job is,
I have to try it for a few days at least.

39:20.080 --> 39:22.760
You think you can just come and go
as you please?

39:22.840 --> 39:24.160
I don't care what this place is,

39:24.240 --> 39:27.640
but in the Western Capital,
you can't just detain people.

39:31.600 --> 39:33.120
- Taozhi!
- Taozhi!

39:33.200 --> 39:34.320
How could you hit her?

39:34.400 --> 39:35.760
Stop causing trouble.

39:36.680 --> 39:38.880
If you break the rules,
you take the punishment!

39:39.800 --> 39:41.680
But I never agreed to work for you.

39:41.760 --> 39:42.840
You want to leave?

39:42.920 --> 39:44.880
Fine. Ten guan.

39:44.960 --> 39:47.000
- Ten… Ten guan?
- Ten guan?

39:47.080 --> 39:48.120
Ten guan?

39:57.240 --> 39:58.360
What do we do now?

40:02.720 --> 40:07.000
Do you still think
this is a legitimate business?

40:19.040 --> 40:21.160
Where did you find Hanxiao?

40:28.520 --> 40:30.200
Didn't I tell you already?

40:31.120 --> 40:33.240
In an alley of Daozheng Ward.

40:34.160 --> 40:35.720
She was lying by a gutter.

40:35.800 --> 40:37.720
There are many alleys in Daozheng Ward.

40:38.240 --> 40:39.480
Which one?

40:41.960 --> 40:42.880
I don't remember.

40:43.400 --> 40:46.400
Did you see anything else on the way back?

40:48.480 --> 40:49.400
Yes.

40:51.360 --> 40:54.040
That was the day
Hanxiao and I got married.

40:55.040 --> 40:56.320
How could I forget?

40:56.920 --> 41:00.120
Everyone along the way congratulated me.

41:00.800 --> 41:03.360
Groups of young women chattered,

41:04.400 --> 41:06.080
all gossiping about me.

41:06.720 --> 41:08.560
But they were all just ordinary girls,

41:09.720 --> 41:10.960
nothing like Hanxiao.

41:11.600 --> 41:13.320
She carried a subtle scent,

41:14.320 --> 41:16.280
fragrant from afar

41:17.200 --> 41:20.800
and sweet up close.

41:21.480 --> 41:23.720
That's why I always wanted to be near her.

41:24.280 --> 41:25.480
Anything else?

41:27.600 --> 41:28.560
Yes.

41:29.080 --> 41:30.720
There were flowers,

41:31.680 --> 41:33.040
so many flowers,

41:33.120 --> 41:35.480
more than I'd ever seen in my life.

41:35.560 --> 41:36.720
They were in all colors,

41:37.320 --> 41:39.760
even more beautiful than those
in Consort Shu's garden.

41:40.600 --> 41:41.720
Honestly,

41:42.480 --> 41:46.680
only Hanxiao could have made them
look so beautiful.

41:47.720 --> 41:51.000
There were also drumming, festive music,

41:51.080 --> 41:52.080
bells ringing,

41:52.800 --> 41:54.080
and people singing.

41:54.600 --> 41:55.840
It was lovely.

41:55.920 --> 41:58.800
Little kids ran over with baskets,

41:58.880 --> 42:00.800
asking for lucky money.

42:00.880 --> 42:04.080
I handed out candy,
and they were all so happy.

42:16.040 --> 42:18.200
This is the only canal
that runs through Daozheng Ward.

42:18.280 --> 42:19.760
Let's search from north to south.

42:24.200 --> 42:26.000
We've walked so far,
but we still haven't seen

42:26.080 --> 42:27.480
flowers, children, or women.

42:30.280 --> 42:33.400
One or two wen for needles, thread,

42:33.480 --> 42:36.120
or floral cloth for your shoes!

42:36.960 --> 42:38.200
Come take a look!

42:39.840 --> 42:41.360
- I want it!
- Give it to me first!

42:42.040 --> 42:43.560
Could this be what Lou Chuo described?

42:43.640 --> 42:46.360
There were also drumming, festive music,
and bells ringing.

42:46.440 --> 42:50.760
Little kids ran over with baskets,
asking for lucky money.

42:51.880 --> 42:54.200
But where are the flowers and the ladies?

42:55.160 --> 42:56.800
If what he called "festive music"
wasn't really music,

42:56.880 --> 42:58.960
maybe the "flowers" weren't real either.

43:01.440 --> 43:03.760
Sure. No problem. Take it.

43:07.720 --> 43:09.200
So these are the colorful "flowers."

43:09.280 --> 43:10.320
LANTERN SHOP

43:10.960 --> 43:13.720
Look. These lotus lanterns
do look like flowers.

43:14.440 --> 43:15.280
We've found the "flowers."

43:15.360 --> 43:17.160
That stall was the last place
Lou Chuo passed by.

43:17.240 --> 43:18.320
Before that, it was this lantern shop.

43:19.040 --> 43:20.080
Let's keep walking.

43:23.240 --> 43:25.600
This must be where he thought
people were talking about him.

43:26.200 --> 43:28.680
Groups of young women chattered,

43:29.320 --> 43:30.360
all gossiping about me.

43:30.440 --> 43:31.720
That's so funny.

43:31.800 --> 43:34.520
The gutter he mentioned should be nearby.

43:35.560 --> 43:37.160
‪Look at it! How nice.

43:52.200 --> 43:53.400
It's the smell of face powder.

43:53.920 --> 43:55.880
Strange. This alley is so narrow,

43:55.960 --> 43:57.080
and there are no mansions around.

43:57.160 --> 43:58.920
Who here would use so much powder?

43:59.000 --> 44:00.960
Unless there's a tavern or brothel nearby.

44:07.800 --> 44:08.760
We're here?

44:10.760 --> 44:11.600
Hanguang Lane?

44:11.680 --> 44:14.400
So Lou Chuo ran into Hanxiao near the spot
where he killed Hu Da?

44:18.280 --> 44:19.760
According to Hu Da's coachman,

44:19.840 --> 44:22.680
he was only gone
for less than an hour each time.

44:22.760 --> 44:25.720
To get back to Linglong Residence in time
without being noticed,

44:25.800 --> 44:28.120
he could only have come this far.

44:28.200 --> 44:29.840
This building is within this range.

44:29.920 --> 44:32.400
But the Inner Guards have already checked.

44:32.480 --> 44:35.000
All the taverns and residences
claimed they never received Hu Da.

44:35.800 --> 44:36.840
Let's go take a look.

44:44.440 --> 44:47.240
XIUHONG HOUSE

45:06.320 --> 45:07.160
ZHENNIANG

45:07.240 --> 45:09.880
Madam, sir, what brings you here?

45:10.480 --> 45:13.080
Do you sell silk or embroidery here?

45:13.160 --> 45:14.400
Embroidery.

45:14.480 --> 45:16.640
But you don't come
to this ward often, do you?

45:17.840 --> 45:20.360
- How can you tell?
- We only do business with merchants,

45:20.440 --> 45:21.880
never private customers.

45:25.040 --> 45:27.120
No wonder you can afford
such fine benzoin resin incense.

45:27.720 --> 45:29.240
We owe it all to our loyal clients.

45:30.440 --> 45:32.880
Supplying embroidery to merchants
must require a lot of embroiderers, right?

45:33.840 --> 45:35.800
- Seven or eight.
- That's not so many.

45:35.880 --> 45:38.520
A truly skilled embroiderer
can do the work

45:38.600 --> 45:39.640
of ten ordinary ones.

45:41.040 --> 45:42.080
How was Hanxiao?

45:44.680 --> 45:45.680
Who is that?

45:46.880 --> 45:48.120
You don't know her?

45:48.200 --> 45:49.240
Never heard of her.

45:49.320 --> 45:51.360
There was a murder
in Hanguang Lane a few days ago.

45:51.440 --> 45:52.680
Did you hear?

45:53.400 --> 45:55.680
Sir, stop. You're scaring me.

45:56.280 --> 45:57.920
- You knew the victim?
- No, I didn't.

46:00.440 --> 46:03.120
I've never seen
such a grand embroidery house.

46:03.200 --> 46:05.080
Would you mind showing us around?

46:05.680 --> 46:07.960
Though we're open for business,

46:08.040 --> 46:09.680
this is still a private residence.

46:09.760 --> 46:10.800
We only welcome regulars.

46:11.640 --> 46:12.880
We've been here for a while.

46:12.960 --> 46:14.360
Why haven't we seen a single embroiderer?

46:15.000 --> 46:16.840
They just finished
a big job a few days ago.

46:16.920 --> 46:17.800
They're all resting.

46:18.440 --> 46:19.480
Do all your embroiderers live here?

46:20.440 --> 46:21.280
Yes.

46:24.760 --> 46:25.600
It's awfully quiet.

46:27.320 --> 46:29.920
They're all young ladies.
They're out enjoying themselves.

46:33.520 --> 46:34.480
Please, stay here.

46:35.200 --> 46:36.800
What are you doing?
You startled the guests!

46:36.880 --> 46:37.880
It's nothing!

46:39.040 --> 46:40.560
It was probably just a rat.
